{"format":2,"manifest":{"tmApi":1,"id":"wakatime-sync","name":{"en":"WakaTime sync","zh-CN":"WakaTime 同步","zh-TW":"WakaTime 同步"},"description":{"en":"Send Token Monitor AI token usage to WakaTime as heartbeats, and show your WakaTime day in a card. Works for one machine or a shared Hub.","zh-CN":"把 Token Monitor 的 AI token 用量作为 WakaTime 心跳上报，并在卡片里显示 WakaTime 当天数据；单机或共享 Hub 都能用。","zh-TW":"把 Token Monitor 的 AI token 用量作為 WakaTime 心跳上報，並在卡片裡顯示 WakaTime 當天資料；單機或共享 Hub 都能用。"},"version":"0.5.0","author":"Ayeez757","homepage":"https://github.com/Ayeez757/wakatime-sync","ui":"ui.mjs","backend":"backend.cjs","css":["panel.css"],"files":["ui.mjs","backend.cjs","shared/wakatime-core.cjs","panel.css","README.md","README.zh-CN.md","README.zh-TW.md","CHANGELOG.md","LICENSE","assets/icon.svg"],"background":true,"backgroundDescription":{"en":"Polls Token Monitor usage every minute and posts token deltas to WakaTime.","zh-CN":"每分钟读取 Token Monitor 的用量变化，并把 token 增量上报到 WakaTime。","zh-TW":"每分鐘讀取 Token Monitor 的用量變化，並把 token 增量上報到 WakaTime。"},"category":"automation","engines":{"tokenMonitor":">=0.82.0"},"views":[{"id":"card","title":{"en":"WakaTime sync","zh-CN":"WakaTime 同步","zh-TW":"WakaTime 同步"},"surfaces":["home","page"],"defaultSurfaces":["home","page"]}],"settings":{"version":4,"fields":[{"id":"enabled","type":"boolean","label":{"en":"Send heartbeats to WakaTime","zh-CN":"向 WakaTime 发送心跳","zh-TW":"向 WakaTime 傳送心跳"},"description":{"en":"Off pauses uploads but keeps saved baselines.","zh-CN":"关闭后暂停上报，但保留已保存的 token 基线。","zh-TW":"關閉後暫停上報，但保留已儲存的 token 基準。"},"default":false},{"id":"apiKey","type":"string","label":{"en":"WakaTime API key","zh-CN":"WakaTime API key","zh-TW":"WakaTime API key"},"description":{"en":"Write-only plugin key from wakatime.com/api-key. Stored in this plugin's preference file, which is plain JSON, not a secret vault.","zh-CN":"wakatime.com/api-key 的插件专用 key（只写）。保存在插件普通偏好文件（明文 JSON），不是加密保险库。","zh-TW":"wakatime.com/api-key 的外掛專用 key（唯寫）。儲存在外掛一般偏好檔案（明文 JSON），不是加密保險箱。"},"default":"","maxLength":200},{"id":"oauthToken","type":"string","label":{"en":"WakaTime OAuth access token (optional, read stats)","zh-CN":"WakaTime OAuth access token（可选，读取统计）","zh-TW":"WakaTime OAuth access token（可選，讀取統計）"},"description":{"en":"Personal token from wakatime.com/oauth. API keys cannot read stats; only the WakaTime card needs this.","zh-CN":"来自 wakatime.com/oauth 的个人 token。API key 只能写不能读，只有卡片统计需要它。","zh-TW":"來自 wakatime.com/oauth 的個人 token。API key 只能寫不能讀，只有卡片統計需要它。"},"default":"","maxLength":4096},{"id":"scope","type":"select","label":{"en":"Which sessions to upload","zh-CN":"上报哪些会话","zh-TW":"上報哪些工作階段"},"description":{"en":"Auto keeps this machine only when the App reads a shared Hub, so other devices are never uploaded twice. Choose all devices only when nothing else reports them.","zh-CN":"选“自动”时，若 App 数据源是共享 Hub，只上报本机设备，避免其他设备被重复上报；只有没有其他上报方时才选“所有设备”。","zh-TW":"選「自動」時，若 App 資料來源是共享 Hub，只上報本機裝置，避免其他裝置被重複上報；只有沒有其他上報方時才選「所有裝置」。"},"default":"auto","options":[{"value":"auto","label":{"en":"Auto (this machine when detected)","zh-CN":"自动（检测到本机时只用本机）","zh-TW":"自動（偵測到本機時只用本機）"}},{"value":"this-device","label":{"en":"This machine only","zh-CN":"仅本机","zh-TW":"僅本機"}},{"value":"aggregate","label":{"en":"All devices (Hub aggregate)","zh-CN":"所有设备（Hub 汇总）","zh-TW":"所有裝置（Hub 彙總）"}}]},{"id":"category","type":"select","label":{"en":"WakaTime category","zh-CN":"WakaTime 分类","zh-TW":"WakaTime 分類"},"description":{"en":"AI coding keeps AI work separate from manual Coding in WakaTime charts.","zh-CN":"选 ai coding 可让 AI 工作与手工 Coding 在 WakaTime 图表里分开统计。","zh-TW":"選 ai coding 可讓 AI 工作與手動 Coding 在 WakaTime 圖表裡分開統計。"},"default":"ai coding","options":[{"value":"ai coding","label":{"en":"AI coding","zh-CN":"AI coding","zh-TW":"AI coding"}},{"value":"coding","label":{"en":"Coding","zh-CN":"Coding","zh-TW":"Coding"}},{"value":"writing docs","label":{"en":"Writing docs","zh-CN":"Writing docs","zh-TW":"Writing docs"}},{"value":"researching","label":{"en":"Researching","zh-CN":"Researching","zh-TW":"Researching"}}]},{"id":"language","type":"select","label":{"en":"Heartbeat language","zh-CN":"心跳语言","zh-TW":"心跳語言"},"description":{"en":"WakaTime shows heartbeats without a language under \"Other\". AI tags them as AI; Text uses WakaTime's Text language; client uses the tool name; none leaves them language-less.","zh-CN":"没有语言的心跳会在 WakaTime 里显示为 Other。AI 标为 AI；Text 使用 WakaTime 的 Text；client 用工具名；none 不写语言。","zh-TW":"沒有語言的心跳會在 WakaTime 裡顯示為 Other。AI 標為 AI；Text 使用 WakaTime 的 Text；client 用工具名；none 不寫語言。"},"default":"ai","options":[{"value":"ai","label":{"en":"AI","zh-CN":"AI","zh-TW":"AI"}},{"value":"text","label":{"en":"Text","zh-CN":"Text","zh-TW":"Text"}},{"value":"client","label":{"en":"Tool name","zh-CN":"工具名","zh-TW":"工具名"}},{"value":"none","label":{"en":"No language (Other)","zh-CN":"不写语言（Other）","zh-TW":"不寫語言（Other）"}}]},{"id":"includeCacheTokens","type":"boolean","label":{"en":"Count cached input tokens as ai_input_tokens","zh-CN":"把缓存命中/写入 token 计入 ai_input_tokens","zh-TW":"把快取命中／寫入 token 計入 ai_input_tokens"},"description":{"en":"Cached prompt tokens dominate real AI spend; turn this off if you only want fresh input tokens.","zh-CN":"缓存 token 占 AI 成本大头；只统计新输入 token 时关闭。","zh-TW":"快取 token 佔 AI 成本大宗；只統計新輸入 token 時關閉。"},"default":true},{"id":"projectMode","type":"select","label":{"en":"Project name source","zh-CN":"项目名来源","zh-TW":"專案名來源"},"description":{"en":"Label uses Token Monitor's project name; folder uses the workspace folder; none leaves WakaTime projects empty.","zh-CN":"label 用 Token Monitor 的项目名；folder 用工作区文件夹名；none 不上报项目。","zh-TW":"label 用 Token Monitor 的專案名；folder 用工作區資料夾名；none 不上報專案。"},"default":"label","options":[{"value":"label","label":{"en":"Token Monitor project label","zh-CN":"Token Monitor 项目名","zh-TW":"Token Monitor 專案名"}},{"value":"folder","label":{"en":"Workspace folder name","zh-CN":"工作区文件夹名","zh-TW":"工作區資料夾名"}},{"value":"none","label":{"en":"No project","zh-CN":"不上报项目","zh-TW":"不上報專案"}}]},{"id":"projectPrefix","type":"string","label":{"en":"Project name prefix","zh-CN":"项目名前缀","zh-TW":"專案名前綴"},"description":{"en":"Optional, for example \"ai-\" to keep AI projects visually grouped.","zh-CN":"可选，例如 \"ai-\"，让 AI 项目在 WakaTime 里成组显示。","zh-TW":"可選，例如 \"ai-\"，讓 AI 專案在 WakaTime 裡成組顯示。"},"default":"","maxLength":64},{"id":"pollSeconds","type":"number","label":{"en":"Upload interval (seconds)","zh-CN":"上报间隔（秒）","zh-TW":"上報間隔（秒）"},"default":60,"min":30,"max":900,"integer":true},{"id":"preferHub","type":"boolean","label":{"en":"Let the Hub bridge upload when present","zh-CN":"检测到 Hub 桥时由 Hub 上报","zh-TW":"偵測到 Hub 橋時由 Hub 上報"},"description":{"en":"When this machine's Token Monitor points at a Hub whose bridge answers on port 17322, the bridge uploads every device and this plugin pauses to avoid double counting. Falls back to local uploads when the bridge is unreachable.","zh-CN":"当本机 Token Monitor 连接的 Hub 上运行着桥（17322 端口应答）时，由 Hub 统一上报所有设备，本插件暂停以避免重复计数；桥不可达时自动恢复本机上报。","zh-TW":"當本機 Token Monitor 連線的 Hub 上執行著橋（17322 埠應答）時，由 Hub 統一上報所有裝置，此外掛暫停以避免重複計數；橋不可達時自動恢復本機上報。"},"default":true},{"id":"hubBridgeUrl","type":"string","label":{"en":"Hub bridge URL (optional)","zh-CN":"Hub 桥地址（可选）","zh-TW":"Hub 橋位址（可選）"},"description":{"en":"Empty means auto: same host as the Hub, port 17322. Set it only when the bridge listens elsewhere.","zh-CN":"留空表示自动：与 Hub 同主机、17322 端口。桥不在该地址时才需要填。","zh-TW":"留空表示自動：與 Hub 同主機、17322 埠。橋不在該位址時才需要填。"},"default":"","maxLength":512},{"id":"dryRun","type":"boolean","label":{"en":"Dry run (log heartbeats without sending)","zh-CN":"试运行（只记录，不发送）","zh-TW":"試執行（只記錄，不傳送）"},"default":false}]}},"files":{"ui.mjs":"","backend.cjs":"","shared/wakatime-core.cjs":"","panel.css":"","README.md":"","README.zh-CN.md":"","README.zh-TW.md":"","CHANGELOG.md":"","LICENSE":"","assets/icon.svg":""}}